{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107143","id":2569969338,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZLp66","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107143","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107143.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107143.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107143","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107143/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107143/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107143/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3613306bbaec6bf330819e18a7cd3c6242ef8265","number":107143,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix miscellaneous oddities around the class reference (part 5)","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Continuation of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105073\r\n\r\nThis PR addressed yet yet another huge chunk of class reference oddities I remembered to note down for later while localizing the class reference. Some of these are clear typos, some are inconsistencies, some are just awkward.\r\n\r\nOf particular note:\r\n- Link to the existing constants in **CameraFeed**'s `set_format`\r\n- Modify some descriptions of **EditorExportPlatformExtension** and **ReferenceRect** for clarity\r\n- Modify some descriptions of **Animation**, **EditorExportPreset**, **MeshDataTool**, **PointMesh**, and **LookAtModifier3D** substantially\r\n- Removed navigation's \"_(as 2D uses the 3D server behind the scene)._\"\r\n\t- It _should_ be incorrect now. CC @smix8 @AThousandShips\r\n- Be more explicit in some some navigation server methods, instead of \"e.g.\"\r\n\t- See [Rocketchat discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/navigation/thread/HmCe9HG3oZ4cEMZgM)\r\n- Removed a formula in plain text in **ResourceImporterImageFont**\r\n\t- We should genuinely avoid expressions like \"columns * rows\", especially for simple formulas. It's hard to parse\r\n- Link to the documentation in **ProjectSetting**'s shadow atlas descriptions\r\n\t- That is, instead of vaguely saying so with \"see the documentation\"\r\n\t- The reworded descriptions are partially taken from **Viewport**'s corresponding properties\r\n- Elaborate more on what \"_lacunarity_\" is in **FastNoiseLite**'s `domain_warp_fractal_lacunarity`.\r\n\t- This term is so niche most languages genuinely don't have a term for it\r\n- Standardize the examples in **RegEx**'s class\r\n- Replace `x` with `×` character in more places\r\n- Replace a few occurrences (_often the only ones_) of \"comprise\", \"constitute\", \"multi-channel\", \"resemble\", \"comma-delimited\", \"post process\", \"pre process\", \"made up\", \"is slated\" with more common alternatives\r\n- Fixed occurrences of \"Compatibility renderer\" being in lowercase\r\n- Fixed an occurrence of COLLADA not being fully capitalized\r\n- Fixed \"parameters\" being referred as \"arguments\" in a few places\r\n- Fixed some missing articles on the way\r\n\r\nFor some of the descriptions affected, additional tweaks have been made to justify a whole translation string change.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_adm